  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Department for Health &amp; Social Care (DHSC) ODA-eligible administrative costs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK Department of Health and Social Care (DHSC) helps people to live more independent, healthier lives for longer. Our Official Development Assistance (ODA) funded programmes take this objective beyond the UK to address global health challenges for the benefit of people living in low- and middle-income countries (LMICs). The ODA administrative budget funds staff salaries, training, travel and other administrative costs to deliver ODA programmes and activities, including IT and accommodation overheads, and legal, advisory and commercial support.</narrative>
  </description>
